WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.500
<v Glaucia>Prince… look at the last star.

2
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.100
<v Glaucia>It's pulling everything in!

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.000
[Prince barks] Woof!

4
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.600
<v Glaucia>Wow… it didn't end. It was reborn!

5
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.400
[Prince barks] Woof, woof!

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Glaucia>Every world we visited became a star.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.400
<v Glaucia>Wait… this last one is different.

8
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:45.900
[Prince barks] Woof?

9
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Glaucia>A signal… from beyond the map.

10
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.700
<v Glaucia>It's calling us.

11
00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.800
<v Glaucia>Ready for the next orbit?

12
00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.000
[Prince barks] Woof, woof!
